{
  "spoken_lines": [
    {
      "key": "gq003_02_iris_intro_01",
      "string_id": "6322358098829564018",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "The cache was not carrying one identity. It was carrying pieces of several. One of them is still moving through the city.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_02_iris_intro_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 8400
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_02_v_choice_quiet_spine_line",
      "string_id": "16140224469024934404",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Iris",
      "text": "Start clean. What did Quiet Spine actually move?",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_02_v_choice_quiet_spine_line.wem",
      "duration_ms": 3600
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_02_iris_rsp_quiet_spine_01",
      "string_id": "7162335554796403870",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Instructions for rebuilding people. Habits, sensory anchors, reflexes, the memories that tell you a room is yours. Split apart, they look like damaged braindances. Put together, they can impersonate a life.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_02_iris_rsp_quiet_spine_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 13200
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_02_v_choice_memory_courier_line",
      "string_id": "375226852156039159",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Iris",
      "text": "How do you hide somebody else's memories in a courier?",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_02_v_choice_memory_courier_line.wem",
      "duration_ms": 4000
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_02_iris_rsp_memory_courier_01",
      "string_id": "5648330956070396067",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "You do not hide them. You make the courier experience them. A smell that feels familiar. A route home they have never walked. The implant calls it memory because the body cannot file it anywhere else.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_02_iris_rsp_memory_courier_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 13200
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_02_v_choice_kabuki_line",
      "string_id": "18274103743146964361",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Iris",
      "text": "Common Ground's relay. Where did it fit?",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_02_v_choice_kabuki_line.wem",
      "duration_ms": 3200
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_02_iris_rsp_kabuki_01",
      "string_id": "18312265285763703825",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Selection. Its tenant classifier found people with debt, unstable housing, obsolete implants, missing legal identities. People whose absence would be recorded as a database correction.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_02_iris_rsp_kabuki_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 10800
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_02_iris_rsp_kabuki_02",
      "string_id": "18312261987228819192",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Cinder shut the relay down. Black Lantern moved its next pair early.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_02_iris_rsp_kabuki_02.wem",
      "duration_ms": 4800
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_02_v_choice_patch_knowledge_line",
      "string_id": "14388521868133274339",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Iris",
      "text": "Patch knew Quiet Spine used flesh couriers. How much did he tell you?",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_02_v_choice_patch_knowledge_line.wem",
      "duration_ms": 5200
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_02_iris_rsp_patch_knowledge_01",
      "string_id": "17034431306131384269",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Less than he knew and more than he admits. Ask him after we have the woman back. Right now his shame is less urgent than her pulse.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_02_iris_rsp_patch_knowledge_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 9600
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_02_v_choice_mara_line",
      "string_id": "4040593166426294711",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Iris",
      "text": "Name and location.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_02_v_choice_mara_line.wem",
      "duration_ms": 1600
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_02_iris_rsp_mara_01",
      "string_id": "9573737215734977791",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Mara Venn. Apartment systems tech. Pair Zero-Seven-A. A scav clinic is holding her until tonight's handoff.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_02_iris_rsp_mara_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 7200
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_02_iris_rsp_mara_02",
      "string_id": "9573738315246606002",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Pair Zero-Seven-B is moving separately inside a freight vehicle. It carries the reconstruction cipher. Dispatch authority is K. Morita.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_02_iris_rsp_mara_02.wem",
      "duration_ms": 8000
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_02_v_choice_accept_line",
      "string_id": "18373931906066203570",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Iris",
      "text": "Send me the clinic.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_02_v_choice_accept_line.wem",
      "duration_ms": 2000
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_02_iris_rsp_accept_01",
      "string_id": "2994067373197485570",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Not yet. Mark the paired shipment first. If we touch Mara before I can follow the cipher, they wipe her and move the vehicle.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_02_iris_rsp_accept_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 8800
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_02_v_rsp_accept_01",
      "string_id": "9221727656376167883",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Iris",
      "text": "Then I mark the shipment and bring her out.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_02_v_rsp_accept_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 3600
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_02_iris_rsp_accept_02",
      "string_id": "2994066273685857359",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Read my report. The transfer window opens tonight.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_02_iris_rsp_accept_02.wem",
      "duration_ms": 3600
    }
  ],
  "choice_lines": [
    {
      "key": "gq003_02_v_choice_quiet_spine_short",
      "string_id": "13703188061528726504",
      "text": "What did Quiet Spine move?"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_02_v_choice_memory_courier_short",
      "string_id": "2442289501336508741",
      "text": "How does someone carry a memory?"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_02_v_choice_kabuki_short",
      "string_id": "12240205284570378899",
      "text": "Where did the Kabuki relay fit?"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_02_v_choice_patch_knowledge_short",
      "string_id": "8274706139254088625",
      "text": "How much did Patch know?"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_02_v_choice_mara_short",
      "string_id": "6194050024904092165",
      "text": "Where is Mara?"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_02_v_choice_accept_short",
      "string_id": "5785925356009313578",
      "text": "I'll bring her out."
    }
  ],
